; Handwritten OCS: Ax=Wy x (0,0,-1)=(-1,0,0); Ay=N x Ax=(0,1,0). Reflect x, reverse ARC endpoints and negate bulges.
; Raw DXF values independently checked against CI run 39925415850, job 120320505295.
D = DXF source=r11-negative-ocs
? count D -> ARC 2; CIRCLE 1; LINE 1; LWPOLYLINE 1
? unhandled D -> none
? entity D B1 -> LINE start=3,4 end=8,-2 extrusion=0,0,-1
? entity D B2 -> CIRCLE center=-5,6 radius=3 extrusion=0,0,-1
? entity D B3 -> ARC center=-2,3 radius=4 start-angle=330 end-angle=30 extrusion=0,0,-1
? entity D B4 -> ARC center=4,2 radius=5 start-angle=150 end-angle=240 extrusion=0,0,-1
? entity D B5 -> LWPOLYLINE closed=yes vertex=-1,2 bulge=-0.5 vertex=-7,2 bulge=1 vertex=-7,8 extrusion=0,0,-1
? bbox D:B2 -> -8,3 -2,9
? bbox D:B3 -> 1.4641016151377544,1 2,5
? roundtrip D -> identical
